# .sdd/
# Agent configurations
# NOTE: do not blanket-ignore `.claude/`. CLAUDE.md instructs agents to read skills from
# `.claude/skills/`, so ignoring the whole directory made that instruction unactionable — the
# skills could never be committed where the documentation said to look. Only local, machine
# specific agent state is ignored here.
.claude/agents/
.claude/hooks/
.claude/commands/utils/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/**/node_modules/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.agent/
# GEMINI.md
# AGENTS.md

# Local dev tooling (not part of the project)
.entire/